1
00:00:01,908 --> 00:00:03,167
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is not good.</font>

2
00:00:33,237 --> 00:00:34,406
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's over...</font>

3
00:00:36,034 --> 00:00:37,703
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just what you'd expect
from Lord Kazekage!</font>

4
00:00:37,902 --> 00:00:40,530
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. This village will be safe</font>

5
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,228
<font color="#FFFFFF">as long as we have
Lord Kazekage!</font>

6
00:00:50,889 --> 00:00:51,719
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hold on!</font>

7
00:03:22,438 --> 00:03:24,066
<font color="#FFFFFF">This sand's such
a pain in the neck.</font>

8
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:31,599
<font color="#FFFFFF">You fool...!</font>

9
00:03:33,427 --> 00:03:34,626
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you really think</font>

10
00:03:34,655 --> 00:03:36,094
<font color="#FFFFFF">you can get away
from Gaara's sand?</font>

11
00:03:43,786 --> 00:03:45,215
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Kazekage Stands Tall!</font>

12
00:03:45,245 --> 00:03:48,212
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never thought this would be
my reason for losing...</font>

13
00:03:53,037 --> 00:03:56,074
<font color="#FFFFFF">I should've just gone ahead
and finished the book...</font>

14
00:03:57,932 --> 00:04:01,898
<font color="#FFFFFF">But how can you even
read such a boring book?</font>

15
00:04:02,268 --> 00:04:02,927
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

16
00:04:03,467 --> 00:04:06,024
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Pervy Sage loaned it to me,</font>

17
00:04:06,064 --> 00:04:09,391
<font color="#FFFFFF">but it was so boring
I didn't even make it ten pages.</font>

18
00:04:10,190 --> 00:04:12,558
<font color="#FFFFFF">So of course, I don't know
how the book ends.</font>

19
00:04:17,812 --> 00:04:20,210
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even without Naruto knowing
the ending of the book...</font>

20
00:04:20,250 --> 00:04:23,277
<font color="#FFFFFF">we figured you'd respond
if we mentioned the name,</font>

21
00:04:23,307 --> 00:04:25,105
<font color="#FFFFFF">"Make-Out Tactics."</font>

22
00:04:26,144 --> 00:04:27,503
<font color="#FFFFFF">Pretty good strategy, huh?</font>

23
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:33,067
<font color="#FFFFFF">You two certainly showed me
some growth.</font>

24
00:04:37,333 --> 00:04:38,492
<font color="#FFFFFF">Master!</font>

25
00:04:38,691 --> 00:04:41,089
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi, do you have
something to say?</font>

26
00:04:41,758 --> 00:04:45,954
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, they did a great job
taking the bells away from me, so...</font>

27
00:04:46,454 --> 00:04:47,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes.</font>

28
00:04:50,350 --> 00:04:52,048
<font color="#FFFFFF">What're you talking about?</font>

29
00:04:52,148 --> 00:04:55,714
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're talking about
your status for the future.</font>

30
00:04:56,873 --> 00:04:58,741
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our status...?</font>

31
00:04:59,041 --> 00:05:00,769
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Naruto Uzumaki!
- Huh?</font>

32
00:05:01,109 --> 00:05:01,968
<font color="#FFFFFF">Answer me.</font>

33
00:05:02,038 --> 00:05:03,307
<font color="#FFFFFF">Y-Yeah!</font>

34
00:05:03,666 --> 00:05:04,705
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura Haruno!</font>

35
00:05:04,865 --> 00:05:05,535
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes!</font>

36
00:05:09,730 --> 00:05:11,259
<font color="#FFFFFF">The two of you and...</font>

37
00:05:11,299 --> 00:05:13,327
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Hatake...</font>

38
00:05:13,357 --> 00:05:16,354
<font color="#FFFFFF">The three of you shall
form Team Kakashi!</font>

39
00:05:18,951 --> 00:05:19,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Team Kakashi...</font>

40
00:05:19,950 --> 00:05:24,446
<font color="#FFFFFF">S-Say, what does that mean?</font>

41
00:05:24,815 --> 00:05:27,712
<font color="#FFFFFF">The two of you will form
a team with me</font>

42
00:05:27,742 --> 00:05:29,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">and we'll carry out
missions together.</font>

43
00:05:31,638 --> 00:05:33,377
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's what this means.</font>

44
00:05:35,804 --> 00:05:37,003
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not like the old days.</font>

45
00:05:37,033 --> 00:05:38,971
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're no longer teacher
and students.</font>

46
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:43,626
<font color="#FFFFFF">We will work together as
equal Leaf Shinobi. Got it?</font>

47
00:05:45,395 --> 00:05:47,822
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sure! I got it!</font>

48
00:05:56,713 --> 00:05:57,682
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro!</font>

49
00:06:00,010 --> 00:06:03,177
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is Lord Gaara fighting right now?
Where is he?</font>

50
00:06:03,447 --> 00:06:04,346
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah.</font>

51
00:06:04,945 --> 00:06:05,874
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's up there...</font>

52
00:06:12,497 --> 00:06:13,536
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...</font>

53
00:07:05,444 --> 00:07:07,213
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sand Coffin...</font>

54
00:07:13,237 --> 00:07:14,036
<font color="#FFFFFF">He did it...</font>

55
00:07:14,106 --> 00:07:16,673
<font color="#FFFFFF">- He did it!
- Yeah!</font>

56
00:07:16,733 --> 00:07:18,801
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Kazekage is amazing!</font>

57
00:07:43,446 --> 00:07:44,575
<font color="#FFFFFF">Did he get away...?</font>

58
00:07:44,775 --> 00:07:47,143
<font color="#FFFFFF">That guy sure is lucky...!</font>

59
00:07:50,170 --> 00:07:51,239
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not bad.</font>

60
00:07:52,897 --> 00:07:53,966
<font color="#FFFFFF">I get it.</font>

61
00:07:53,996 --> 00:07:56,294
<font color="#FFFFFF">The sand he used to crush
my hand</font>

62
00:07:56,334 --> 00:07:58,691
<font color="#FFFFFF">is much faster and more powerful</font>

63
00:07:58,731 --> 00:08:00,829
<font color="#FFFFFF">than ordinary sand taken
from the desert...</font>

64
00:08:07,382 --> 00:08:09,021
<font color="#FFFFFF">According to our information...</font>

65
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:13,077
<font color="#FFFFFF">He always carries with him
a fixed amount of sand...</font>

66
00:08:13,616 --> 00:08:14,915
<font color="#FFFFFF">In other words,</font>

67
00:08:14,945 --> 00:08:17,742
<font color="#FFFFFF">only that sand has been...
specially created</font>

68
00:08:17,772 --> 00:08:20,869
<font color="#FFFFFF">with a large amount
of Chakra built up inside...</font>

69
00:08:22,507 --> 00:08:25,604
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's the sand he uses
for quick defense...</font>

70
00:08:25,634 --> 00:08:28,501
<font color="#FFFFFF">as well instant attacks.</font>

71
00:08:31,229 --> 00:08:32,757
<font color="#FFFFFF">What did they call it again...?</font>

72
00:08:36,423 --> 00:08:37,622
<font color="#FFFFFF">I remember now!</font>

73
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:40,989
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's the "Ultimate Defense"</font>

74
00:08:42,288 --> 00:08:45,814
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's the "Ultimate Defense" sand...</font>

75
00:08:48,841 --> 00:08:49,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">In other words,</font>

76
00:08:50,010 --> 00:08:55,534
<font color="#FFFFFF">the sand from that hole is
what crushed my arm...</font>

77
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:03,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've only got a little bit
of clay left...</font>

78
00:09:17,213 --> 00:09:18,651
<font color="#FFFFFF">I underestimated him...</font>

79
00:09:18,681 --> 00:09:20,849
<font color="#FFFFFF">What you'd call
"not prepared enough."</font>

80
00:09:21,908 --> 00:09:24,006
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is just as
the good man Sasori said...</font>

81
00:09:25,944 --> 00:09:28,641
<font color="#FFFFFF">Will just that bag be enough?</font>

82
00:09:28,971 --> 00:09:31,998
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our opponent will be
using the Jinchuriki...</font>

83
00:09:32,737 --> 00:09:36,164
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've only enough left for
one more homing-type...</font>

84
00:09:37,592 --> 00:09:40,230
<font color="#FFFFFF">and my specialty as well.</font>

85
00:09:49,251 --> 00:09:50,449
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think...</font>

86
00:09:51,718 --> 00:09:53,276
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll destroy this village, after all.</font>

87
00:10:03,067 --> 00:10:04,365
<font color="#FFFFFF">For crying out loud...</font>

88
00:10:09,031 --> 00:10:12,657
<font color="#FFFFFF">How long is that Deidara going to
make me wait?</font>

89
00:10:14,156 --> 00:10:17,422
<font color="#FFFFFF">I told him I don't like waiting...</font>

90
00:10:27,213 --> 00:10:28,781
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Kazekage...</font>

91
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:41,998
<font color="#FFFFFF">Black clothing and
a red cloud pattern...!</font>

92
00:10:42,827 --> 00:10:44,066
<font color="#FFFFFF">Judging from that appearance,</font>

93
00:10:44,096 --> 00:10:45,764
<font color="#FFFFFF">the enemy Lord Kazekage
is fighting against</font>

94
00:10:45,794 --> 00:10:48,092
<font color="#FFFFFF">is likely a member of the organization
called the "Akatsuki."</font>

95
00:10:48,821 --> 00:10:50,219
<font color="#FFFFFF">I knew it.</font>

96
00:10:53,356 --> 00:10:54,116
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro.</font>

97
00:10:54,255 --> 00:10:55,684
<font color="#FFFFFF">What is it?</font>

98
00:11:33,117 --> 00:11:35,544
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara's even using
his "Ultimate Defense" sand</font>

99
00:11:35,574 --> 00:11:36,613
<font color="#FFFFFF">in this fight.</font>

100
00:11:36,873 --> 00:11:39,740
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think it's safe to assume
the enemy is a formidable one.</font>

101
00:11:43,866 --> 00:11:45,204
<font color="#FFFFFF">For the time being,</font>

102
00:11:45,234 --> 00:11:47,762
<font color="#FFFFFF">we need to consider that
Gaara could lose control.</font>

103
00:11:48,801 --> 00:11:51,598
<font color="#FFFFFF">We need to be ready
in case Shukaku appears.</font>

104
00:11:52,627 --> 00:11:54,425
<font color="#FFFFFF">The villagers will be in danger.</font>

105
00:11:56,353 --> 00:11:58,122
<font color="#FFFFFF">That won't happen anymore.</font>

106
00:12:06,313 --> 00:12:09,111
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara will not harm
the people of this village.</font>

107
00:12:11,808 --> 00:12:12,937
<font color="#FFFFFF">Never!</font>

108
00:12:17,532 --> 00:12:19,630
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara, give it up.</font>

109
00:12:21,828 --> 00:12:23,696
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't want to say this,</font>

110
00:12:30,060 --> 00:12:33,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">but you're nothing but
a frightening weapon to the village...</font>

111
00:12:39,780 --> 00:12:41,978
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'll just be a struggle
for you</font>

112
00:12:42,008 --> 00:12:44,645
<font color="#FFFFFF">to join a regular unit
at this point.</font>

113
00:12:45,244 --> 00:12:47,742
<font color="#FFFFFF">The superiors don't think
well of you.</font>

114
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:53,796
<font color="#FFFFFF">And a majority of the village
is scared of you.</font>

115
00:12:57,192 --> 00:12:58,291
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know that...</font>

116
00:13:02,058 --> 00:13:03,526
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know that...</font>

117
00:13:03,556 --> 00:13:06,753
<font color="#FFFFFF">but I will be overcome
with an even greater suffering</font>

118
00:13:06,783 --> 00:13:08,581
<font color="#FFFFFF">if I just wait around...</font>

119
00:13:10,050 --> 00:13:13,416
<font color="#FFFFFF">I just have to work hard and
carve out a future for myself.</font>

120
00:13:14,445 --> 00:13:17,013
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I must not run away
from my path of solitude.</font>

121
00:13:18,671 --> 00:13:21,108
<font color="#FFFFFF">If I do that, someday...</font>

122
00:13:27,162 --> 00:13:30,329
<font color="#FFFFFF">Someday... I can be like him...</font>

123
00:13:31,658 --> 00:13:33,726
<font color="#FFFFFF">So as a Sand Shinobi,</font>

124
00:13:33,756 --> 00:13:35,994
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will strive to become
the Kazekage.</font>

125
00:13:36,993 --> 00:13:40,289
<font color="#FFFFFF">To live... bonded with this village.</font>

126
00:13:42,517 --> 00:13:43,486
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...</font>

127
00:13:45,414 --> 00:13:49,740
<font color="#FFFFFF">I want to work hard...
and be acknowledged by others.</font>

128
00:13:53,176 --> 00:13:56,173
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto Uzumaki made
me believe that...</font>

129
00:13:58,231 --> 00:14:00,199
<font color="#FFFFFF">Having bonds with others...</font>

130
00:14:01,698 --> 00:14:06,293
<font color="#FFFFFF">I only knew hate
and malice up until now.</font>

131
00:14:08,621 --> 00:14:13,556
<font color="#FFFFFF">But now, there's something
I understand about those bonds.</font>

132
00:14:14,455 --> 00:14:17,712
<font color="#FFFFFF">He went so far to tell me about.</font>

133
00:14:19,710 --> 00:14:23,276
<font color="#FFFFFF">I understand that pain,
sadness... and happiness...</font>

134
00:14:23,946 --> 00:14:27,402
<font color="#FFFFFF">can be shared with others.</font>

135
00:14:37,132 --> 00:14:38,791
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto Uzumaki...</font>

136
00:14:39,490 --> 00:14:44,825
<font color="#FFFFFF">I learned that through fighting
and getting to know him.</font>

137
00:14:46,023 --> 00:14:48,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">He knew of the same pain
as me.</font>

138
00:14:49,780 --> 00:14:54,715
<font color="#FFFFFF">And he taught me that I could
change the path of my life.</font>

139
00:14:56,073 --> 00:15:00,968
<font color="#FFFFFF">Someday, I want to feel needed
by someone.</font>

140
00:15:01,908 --> 00:15:04,505
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not as a frightening weapon...</font>

141
00:15:08,231 --> 00:15:11,198
<font color="#FFFFFF">but as the Kazekage
of the Hidden Sand Village.</font>

142
00:15:19,350 --> 00:15:21,688
<font color="#FFFFFF">There are people who need you.</font>

143
00:15:23,886 --> 00:15:25,914
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're the Kazekage
of the Hidden Sand!</font>

144
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:30,639
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Gaara!</font>

145
00:15:31,078 --> 00:15:33,436
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Kazekage!
Hang in there!</font>

146
00:15:36,203 --> 00:15:39,570
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gee, you guys sure got strong.</font>

147
00:15:39,800 --> 00:15:42,797
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never thought you'd really
be able to get the bells...</font>

148
00:15:43,965 --> 00:15:46,593
<font color="#FFFFFF">I just might've surpassed you,
Kakashi Sensei.</font>

149
00:15:46,663 --> 00:15:48,960
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why're you talking all big?</font>

150
00:15:50,359 --> 00:15:54,485
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, but I'm still pretty young,
you see...</font>

151
00:15:55,384 --> 00:15:59,280
<font color="#FFFFFF">The other day, I developed
an incredible new Jutsu...</font>

152
00:15:59,810 --> 00:16:01,977
<font color="#FFFFFF">And it's pretty incredible, you see...</font>

153
00:16:02,007 --> 00:16:03,406
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, that's right.</font>

154
00:16:03,606 --> 00:16:06,902
<font color="#FFFFFF">I haven't had any Ichiraku ramen
since I got back!</font>

155
00:16:06,942 --> 00:16:08,741
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, I'm also pretty hungry</font>

156
00:16:08,771 --> 00:16:11,868
<font color="#FFFFFF">from all that training exercise
since yesterday.</font>

157
00:16:12,237 --> 00:16:14,565
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right! Let's make a beeline
for Ichiraku Ramen!</font>

158
00:16:14,635 --> 00:16:15,394
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right!</font>

159
00:16:19,330 --> 00:16:24,855
<font color="#FFFFFF">They used to be so cute
and react to everything back in the day...</font>

160
00:16:29,050 --> 00:16:33,276
<font color="#FFFFFF">As promised,
I leave Naruto in your care.</font>

161
00:16:34,415 --> 00:16:36,143
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's my first Ichiraku ramen in ages!</font>

162
00:16:36,173 --> 00:16:37,772
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'll be Kakashi Sensei's treat!</font>

163
00:16:37,871 --> 00:16:39,840
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Treat! Treat!
- Treat! Treat!</font>

164
00:16:40,339 --> 00:16:44,065
<font color="#FFFFFF">The actions of the Akatsuki
are gaining momentum...</font>

165
00:16:45,364 --> 00:16:48,201
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm heading off to gather information.</font>

166
00:16:52,527 --> 00:16:53,396
<font color="#FFFFFF">See you around.</font>

167
00:16:54,325 --> 00:16:55,993
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei!</font>

168
00:16:56,153 --> 00:16:56,892
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

169
00:16:57,692 --> 00:16:59,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's been settled that</font>

170
00:16:59,350 --> 00:17:01,818
<font color="#FFFFFF">you're going to treat us
to some ramen!</font>

171
00:17:02,087 --> 00:17:03,786
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hurry up!</font>

172
00:17:04,315 --> 00:17:05,584
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry, guys!</font>

173
00:17:05,983 --> 00:17:11,338
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have to create and turn in
the unit list for the new team!</font>

174
00:17:11,778 --> 00:17:12,936
<font color="#FFFFFF">See you.</font>

175
00:17:13,236 --> 00:17:14,235
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm gone.</font>

176
00:17:15,334 --> 00:17:16,773
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh! He ran away!</font>

177
00:17:17,632 --> 00:17:19,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">He said something about a unit list...</font>

178
00:17:19,470 --> 00:17:22,497
<font color="#FFFFFF">but he's probably just wondering
what happens next in... his book...</font>

179
00:17:23,366 --> 00:17:24,595
<font color="#FFFFFF">That means...</font>

180
00:17:26,593 --> 00:17:29,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then how about we go
on a date, just the two of us?</font>

181
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:31,688
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's fine. But you're treating.</font>

182
00:17:31,718 --> 00:17:32,457
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh...</font>

183
00:17:38,181 --> 00:17:40,779
<font color="#FFFFFF">You could at least pay
for half of the ramen...</font>

184
00:17:40,808 --> 00:17:41,578
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way!</font>

185
00:17:46,173 --> 00:17:48,271
<font color="#FFFFFF">Convene all members
for an emergency meeting!</font>

186
00:17:48,441 --> 00:17:49,240
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, sir!</font>

187
00:17:49,969 --> 00:17:53,096
<font color="#FFFFFF">You secure the reservoir.
Take two units with you!</font>

188
00:17:53,296 --> 00:17:53,935
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, sir.</font>

189
00:17:54,435 --> 00:17:56,333
<font color="#FFFFFF">Seal off the roads in sector A!</font>

190
00:17:56,363 --> 00:17:57,062
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, sir!</font>

191
00:17:57,132 --> 00:17:59,360
<font color="#FFFFFF">We must not assume
there's only one enemy!</font>

192
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:01,658
<font color="#FFFFFF">No matter what happens,
maintain preparations for battle.</font>

193
00:18:01,688 --> 00:18:03,086
<font color="#FFFFFF">We must be ready to respond!</font>

194
00:18:03,756 --> 00:18:04,824
<font color="#FFFFFF">Medical Team!</font>

195
00:18:04,854 --> 00:18:09,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Set up a barrier and lead
all villagers inside! Hurry!</font>

196
00:18:10,149 --> 00:18:13,746
<font color="#FFFFFF">There must not be even one casualty!
Is that clear?</font>

197
00:18:23,536 --> 00:18:28,461
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll provide full support for Gaara...
No... for Lord Kazekage!</font>

198
00:18:31,558 --> 00:18:32,427
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...</font>

199
00:18:40,289 --> 00:18:42,946
<font color="#FFFFFF">Interference from below really
puts a damper on things...</font>

200
00:18:44,685 --> 00:18:45,813
<font color="#FFFFFF">And besides...</font>

201
00:18:54,205 --> 00:18:57,172
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm tired of looking at
your expressionless face.</font>

202
00:19:20,049 --> 00:19:21,248
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a doll</font>

203
00:19:21,278 --> 00:19:23,476
<font color="#FFFFFF">molded from detonating clay
that's got Chakra</font>

204
00:19:23,506 --> 00:19:25,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">and clay eaten by my palm
mixed together...</font>

205
00:19:27,002 --> 00:19:28,770
<font color="#FFFFFF">This specialty of mine...</font>

206
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:31,238
<font color="#FFFFFF">has C3 Chakra,
my most powerful Chakra,</font>

207
00:19:31,268 --> 00:19:32,966
<font color="#FFFFFF">built up inside.</font>

208
00:19:33,236 --> 00:19:35,234
<font color="#FFFFFF">The explosive power is
an exquisite work of art</font>

209
00:19:35,264 --> 00:19:36,563
<font color="#FFFFFF">that I'm very proud of!</font>

210
00:19:37,262 --> 00:19:40,559
<font color="#FFFFFF">- What's that? Hey!
- Yeah, what the heck is it?</font>

211
00:19:42,557 --> 00:19:44,385
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is not good! Get back!</font>

212
00:19:44,784 --> 00:19:45,953
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're too late.</font>

213
00:21:40,439 --> 00:21:44,035
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time, I will finally develop
an ultra cool Jutsu!</font>

214
00:21:44,205 --> 00:21:45,933
<font color="#FFFFFF">The breathtaking arc begins</font>

215
00:21:45,963 --> 00:21:49,200
<font color="#FFFFFF">as I take down
the Akatsuki organization!</font>

216
00:21:49,430 --> 00:21:51,997
<font color="#FFFFFF">What sort of nonsense are
you coming up with, you idiot!</font>

217
00:21:52,027 --> 00:21:52,896
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Sakura...</font>

218
00:21:52,926 --> 00:21:54,854
<font color="#FFFFFF">All you'll do is slurp on
some ramen noodles at the corner</font>

219
00:21:54,894 --> 00:21:55,893
<font color="#FFFFFF">after being dumped by me!</font>

220
00:21:55,923 --> 00:21:58,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">Keep making stuff up,
and you'll get caught by the Police Force!</font>

221
00:21:58,850 --> 00:22:00,119
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I want some of
the spotlight too!</font>

222
00:22:00,149 --> 00:22:02,217
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shut up, Cha!</font>

223
00:22:02,686 --> 00:22:04,345
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time: "Mission Cleared"</font>

